Omission
- [N1] Omitted trace (input 0): i1:To begin the process, trigger the resupply cycle and then check the inventory level. -> i3:Otherwise, if the inventory level is above the minimum, the process ends.
- [N2] Omitted trace (input 1): i1:To begin the process, trigger the resupply cycle and then check the inventory level. -> i2:If the inventory level is at or below the minimum, create a purchase order. -> i4:After creating the purchase order, review it. -> i5:If the purchase status is rejected, rework the purchase order. -> i7:Rework the purchase order and then review it. -> i4:After creating the purchase order, review it.
- [N3] Omitted trace (input 2): i1:To begin the process, trigger the resupply cycle and then check the inventory level. -> i2:If the inventory level is at or below the minimum, create a purchase order. -> i4:After creating the purchase order, review it. -> i6:Otherwise, if the purchase status is approved -> i8:Reserve the funds and send the order to the supplier. -> i9:At the same time, complete the following steps: receive the packing slip and receive the invoice. -> i11:Receive the packing slip and then record it. -> i13:Record the packing slip and the process ends.
- [N4] Omitted trace (input 3): i1:To begin the process, trigger the resupply cycle and then check the inventory level. -> i2:If the inventory level is at or below the minimum, create a purchase order. -> i4:After creating the purchase order, review it. -> i6:Otherwise, if the purchase status is approved -> i8:Reserve the funds and send the order to the supplier. -> i9:At the same time, complete the following steps: receive the packing slip and receive the invoice. -> i12:Receive the invoice and then record it. -> i14:Record the invoice and the process ends.

Addition
- [N5] Added trace (model 0): init(i1) -> action(n1,"Start the resupply process") -> action(n2,"Check inventory level") -> action(n3,"Is inventory level at or below minimum") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n4,"End process due to sufficient inventory") -> end(e1)
- [N6] Added trace (model 1): init(i1) -> action(n1,"Start the resupply process") -> action(n2,"Check inventory level") -> action(n3,"Is inventory level at or below minimum") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n5,"Create purchase order") -> converge(c1) -> action(n6,"Review purchase order") -> action(n7,"Is purchase status rejected") -> branch(b2,XOR) -> action(n14,"Reserve funds") -> action(n15,"Send order to supplier") -> branch(b6,AND) -> action(n16,"Receive packing slip") -> action(n18,"Record packing slip") -> end(e2)
- [N7] Added trace (model 2): init(i1) -> action(n1,"Start the resupply process") -> action(n2,"Check inventory level") -> action(n3,"Is inventory level at or below minimum") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n5,"Create purchase order") -> converge(c1) -> action(n6,"Review purchase order") -> action(n7,"Is purchase status rejected") -> branch(b2,XOR) -> action(n14,"Reserve funds") -> action(n15,"Send order to supplier") -> branch(b6,AND) -> action(n17,"Receive invoice") -> action(n19,"Record invoice") -> end(e3)
